WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.000
Find one value on its axis, go to the line, read the other.

2
00:00:04.899 --> 00:00:08.449
Time is along the bottom. Temperature is up the side.

3
00:00:13.931 --> 00:00:17.231
At nine hours, go up to the line: fourteen degrees.

4
00:00:21.169 --> 00:00:25.844
At fifteen hours it is twenty-four degrees: the point fifteen, twenty-four.
